    "detailed_description": "Play as a stick-figure trying to find out why it is kept imprisoned in this unique puzzle platformer. Turn, swap, and investigate through the various rooms to find answers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHANGE THE PERSPECTIVE</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623350/extras/80665269a025a3a41edb0210543e42a2.poster.avif?t=1650916305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623350/extras/80665269a025a3a41edb0210543e42a2.webm?t=1650916305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623350/extras/80665269a025a3a41edb0210543e42a2.mp4?t=1650916305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Defy the laws of physics by changing between 2D and 3D camera perspectives. Solve puzzles in a new and innovating way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LOOK FROM DIFFERENT ANGLES</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623350/extras/8212a0dc9ae629c4d18de6b875f9ff8d.poster.avif?t=1650916305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623350/extras/8212a0dc9ae629c4d18de6b875f9ff8d.webm?t=1650916305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623350/extras/8212a0dc9ae629c4d18de6b875f9ff8d.mp4?t=1650916305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not everything in this world will be revealed without proper investigation. Try looking at things differently. The answers may be closer than you first expected.",
